flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> FARMER[Farmer Request]

    FARMER --> ROUTE{Route Request}

    ROUTE --> ADVICE[Financial Advice]
    ROUTE --> FINANCING[Financing Request]

    %% =========================
    %% Financial Advice Path
    %% =========================

    ADVICE --> CONTEXT[Collect Financial Context]

    CONTEXT --> SPECIALIST{Need Specialist Data?}

    SPECIALIST -->|Equipment| EQUIPMENT[Equipment Agent]
    SPECIALIST -->|Crop| CROP[Crop Agent]
    SPECIALIST -->|No| OPTIONS[Generate Financial Options]

    EQUIPMENT --> OPTIONS
    CROP --> OPTIONS

    OPTIONS --> TOT[Tree of Thoughts\nCompare Options]

    TOT --> RAG[RAG\nPolicies & Financial Rules]

    RAG --> RECOMMEND[Generate Recommendation]

    RECOMMEND --> END([End])

    %% =========================
    %% Financing Path
    %% =========================

    FINANCING --> ELIGIBILITY[Check Eligibility]

    ELIGIBILITY --> RAG_ELIGIBILITY[RAG\nEligibility Rules]

    RAG_ELIGIBILITY --> ELIGIBLE{Eligible?}

    ELIGIBLE -->|No| REJECT[Explain Rejection]
    REJECT --> END

    ELIGIBLE -->|Yes| DOCUMENTS[Collect Required Documents]

    DOCUMENTS --> WAIT_FARMER{{Wait for Farmer}}

    WAIT_FARMER --> VALIDATE[Validate Documents]

    VALIDATE --> VALID{Documents Valid?}

    VALID -->|No| DOCUMENTS
    VALID -->|Yes| FINANCIAL_ANALYSIS[Assess Financing Need]

    FINANCIAL_ANALYSIS --> TOT_FIN[Tree of Thoughts\nCompare Financing Options]

    TOT_FIN --> HITL{HITL Required?}

    HITL -->|No| SUBMIT[Submit Financing Application]
    HITL -->|Yes| ADMIN[Admin Review]

    ADMIN --> ADMIN_DECISION{Admin Decision}

    ADMIN_DECISION -->|Approve| SUBMIT
    ADMIN_DECISION -->|Reject| REJECT
    ADMIN_DECISION -->|More Info| DOCUMENTS

    SUBMIT --> WAIT_PROVIDER{{Wait for External Response}}

    WAIT_PROVIDER --> PROVIDER{Provider Response}

    PROVIDER -->|Approved| FARMER_CONFIRM[Farmer Confirmation]

    PROVIDER -->|Rejected| PROVIDER_REJECTED[Explain Rejection]
    PROVIDER_REJECTED --> ALTERNATIVE[Generate Alternative Options]
    ALTERNATIVE --> RECOMMEND

    PROVIDER -->|More Information| DOCUMENTS

    FARMER_CONFIRM --> CONFIRMED{Farmer Accepts?}

    CONFIRMED -->|No| ALTERNATIVE
    CONFIRMED -->|Yes| PROCESS[Process Financing]

    PROCESS --> VERIFY[Verify Transaction]

    VERIFY --> END